        527.4367065429688,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "economic support should be provided to enable them to complete the diagnostic process and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4036254882812,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "full course of prescribed treatment.” Multiple descriptions exist that include components of support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3915405273438,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "and education based on individual needs, building a patient-provider partnership and participatory",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.61474609375,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "decision-making. Family-centred care also includes interventions at the level of the household to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.39697265625,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "identify members of the household requiring evaluation for TB disease, TPT, treatment support,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.4320678710938,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "etc. As the concept of family-centred, integrated care may be setting specific, one of the first steps",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.2870483398438,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "in implementation includes clarifying which definition applies to the setting in which it is to be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.40576171875,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "implemented. Similarly, the implementation strategy varies by setting and needs to be country- or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        360.9746398925781,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "region-specific, informed by social, cultural and societal values.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.4256591796875,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "The package of TB services to be provided needs to be defined and developed by the NTP, in close",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4464721679688,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "coordination with other relevant programmes, such as through an existing child and adolescent TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.3782958984375,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "technical working group. This package needs to be based on identifying and addressing capacity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.5884399414062,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "needs for national programmes interested in the uptake of proposed interventions, and ideally based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98529052734375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.446533203125,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "on family and community perceptions on the ideal family-centred model of care. It could include",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.1528930664062,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "community-based models for active contact investigation, identifying children with TB signs and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.4002075195312,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "symptoms or exposure as part of routine growth monitoring services, or an integrated model for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.3961181640625,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "IMCI integration, starting with the sick child and identifying signs and symptoms pointing to a high",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        146.71548461914062,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "likelihood of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.6262817382812,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "Integration can start within the family, by equipping the family with the knowledge to recognize signs",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992146492004395,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.38037109375,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "and symptoms to understand the importance of a history of contact, to know when to seek help at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.385009765625,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "the health care facility and how to minimize stigma related to TB. High yield entry points provide a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.3682250976562,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "good starting point within the health system. For example, child and adolescent TB services can be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.4322509765625,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "integrated in malnutrition clinics, ANC, the expanded programme on immunization, inpatient sites,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.608154296875,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "adult TB and chest clinics, HIV and general paediatric clinics. Ideally TB care should be integrated into",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990796089172363,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.4344482421875,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "general health services, rather than be limited to enhanced coordination between two programmes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        527.5588989257812,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "However, defining an optimal patient flow between services and creating strong linkages between child",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.951642990112305,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5986022949219,
        527.58154296875,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "health entry points and TB clinics remains essential, especially in facilities where services are physically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98333740234375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        527.400390625,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "separated. This is critical to enhance the quality of services, including the follow-up of persons with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.99859619140625,
        527.38916015625,
        468.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "TB during the diagnostic evaluation, to also ensure accuracy of recording and reporting. In the early",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.1986083984375,
        527.4365844726562,
        481.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "phase, pilot programmes could be considered, which should be evaluated and adjusted as needed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.39862060546875,
        164.03611755371094,
        494.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "and then scaled up.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.10260009765625,
        527.62890625,
        516.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "Factors to consider in designing an integrated approach to child and adolescent TB care include",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.302490234375,
        527.428955078125,
        529.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "existing infrastructure (such as baseline health infrastructure, needs for expansion or upgrading), the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.5025634765625,
        527.63671875,
        542.945556640625
      ],
      "text": "applicable regulatory framework, financing, choosing between an operational research setting or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.7025146484375,
        527.4212646484375,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "programmatic implementation, human resource issues (including staffing requirements and human",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.902587890625,
        527.4036254882812,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "resources development such as capacity building/training and consultation skills), monitoring and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1026000976562,
        527.4266357421875,
        582.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "evaluation, conducting qualitative research into community needs, perceptions (including views on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.302490234375,
        187.4990997314453,
        595.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "stigma) and suggestions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        602.8305053710938,
        527.4429321289062,
        617.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "Differentiated service delivery (DSD) : DSD is a person-centred approach developed in the HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.20654296875,
        527.134521484375,
        630.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "programme that simplifies and adapts HIV services across the cascade of care in ways that both serve",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982436180114746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.406494140625,
        527.4002075195312,
        643.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "the needs of people living with and vulnerable to HIV and optimize the available resources in health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.6065063476562,
        527.3914184570312,
        657.0494995117188
      ],
      "text": "systems. The principles of DSD can be applied to prevention, testing, linkage to care, ART initiation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.0125122070312,
        527.4166259765625,
        670.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "(123) and follow-up, and integration of HIV care and coinfections and comorbidities  . This approach",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.0064697265625,
        527.4400024414062,
        683.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "embraces the idea that when families are given the choice to interact with the health system, it could",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
