    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        682.20654296875,
        527.6402587890625,
        696.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "provide a possible mechanism for integration of child and adolescent TB services within primary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.406494140625,
        527.4498901367188,
        709.8494873046875
      ],
      "text": "health or other programmes. Examples of implementing DSD for children and adolescents with or at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
